              "html": "<div class='slot-taken-card'><div class='slot-brand'>Bright Smile Dental</div><div class='slot-icon' aria-hidden='true'>!</div><h2>That time was just taken</h2><p>Another patient booked this appointment time a moment ago. Your details are still safe, and we can check the latest availability again.</p><div class='slot-next'><strong>Next step</strong><br>Choose another time below. The available times will be refreshed before you continue.</div><p class='slot-date'>Looking for another day? <a class='slot-date-link' href='https://amisaad.app.n8n.cloud/form/5d33c475-af35-4ad8-add2-4f22af1aa5ff'>Choose a different date</a></p></div>"
